entries[169500] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Greater Flask of the Currents", ["text"] = "Rank 3\nBinds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to craft a Greater Flask of the Currents more efficiently.\nChance to create multiple flasks.\nRequires Kul Tiran Alchemy (175)\nSell Price:\nGreater Flask of the Currents\nUse: Increases Agility by 108 for 1 hour. Counts as both a Battle and Guardian elixir. This effect persists through death. (3 Sec Cooldown)\nSell Price:\nRequires Zin'anthid (20), Sea Stalk (5), Anchor Weed (5), Crystal Vial" }
