entries[170163] = { ["name"] = "Technique: Glyph of the Dark Depths", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nUse: Teaches you how to inscribe a Glyph of the Dark Depths.\nRequires Kul Tiran Inscription (150)\nSell Price:\nGlyph of the Dark Depths\nClasses: Mage\nUse: Permanently teaches you this glyph.\n\nYour Water Elemental is replaced by a darker Depths Elemental. Exclusive with: Glyph of the Unbound Elemental Glyph of Evaporation Glyph of the Tides Glyph of Storm's Wake Glyph of Steaming Fury Glyph of the Cold Waves\nSell Price:\nRequires Light Parchment , Crimson Ink (10), Ultramarine Ink (30)" }
